# docs/for/editors.md: visitors pass, the shield counts, the editor reads.
title Visitors pass the shield to your pages; the shield counts people, crawlers and bots, and the statistics show it
row  who:box "Visitors" "people, crawlers, bots" | shield:warnbox "request-shield" "counts while they pass" | pages:okbox "Your pages"
row  stats:okbox "Visitors & pages" "views, crawlers, not found"
arrow who -> shield
arrow shield -> pages "almost everyone" go
arrow shield -> stats "counted per hour"
note No visitor is followed from page to page: the counts are per page and per hour.
